---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Shield, Lock, CheckCircle2, ShieldCheck } from 'lucide-react';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy & Data Governance - NovaTools"
  description="Comprehensive privacy policy for NovaTools. Learn how your files remain 100% private in local browser memory and how data governance operates."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8">
    <div class="space-y-2 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] pb-5">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/40 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-mono font-medium text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">
        <Shield class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
        <span>Cryptographic Zero-Knowledge Guarantee</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
        Privacy Policy & Data Governance
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-[#9ca3af] font-mono">
        Last Updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month: 'long', day: 'numeric', year: 'numeric' })}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-[#d1d5db] leading-relaxed">
      {/* Section 1 */}
      <section class="space-y-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-white dark:bg-[#1e2025] p-5 sm:p-6 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">
          1. Zero-Upload Architecture
        </h2>
        <p>
          At NovaTools (<a href="https://toolboxs.tech" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">toolboxs.tech</a>), our fundamental technical premise is that <strong>we do not transmit, collect, process, or store your documents, photos, audio tracks, or videos on any remote servers.</strong>
        </p>
        <p>
          All operations—including PDF merging, audio volume amplification, neural subtitle generation, image compression, video trimming, and EXIF scrubbing—execute <strong>100% locally within your client browser sandbox</strong> using in-browser processing engines, WebCodecs, and Web Workers.
        </p>
      </section>

      {/* Section 2 */}
      <section class="space-y-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-white dark:bg-[#1e2025] p-5 sm:p-6 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">
          2. Zero Data Collection Spec
        </h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-[#9ca3af]">
          <li>Zero collection or retention of document bytes, images, or audio buffers.</li>
          <li>Zero logging of file names, metadata tags, passwords, or transcription text.</li>
          <li>Zero requirement for user accounts, credentials, or tracking identifiers to use any tool.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      {/* Section 3: Google AdSense and Cookies */}
      <section class="space-y-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-white dark:bg-[#1e2025] p-5 sm:p-6 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">
          3. Advertising & Functional Cookies
        </h2>
        <p>
          To maintain free, open-access infrastructure without paywalls, we may serve programmatic advertisements provided by third-party vendors, such as <strong>Google AdSense</strong>.
        </p>
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.06] bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#16171a] p-3.5 space-y-1.5 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-[#9ca3af] font-mono">
          <p>• Third-Party Vendors: Google uses cookies to serve ads based on prior user visits.</p>
          <p>• Opting Out: Users may opt out of personalized advertising via <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">Google Ads Settings</a> or <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">aboutads.info</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* Section 4: Contact */}
      <section class="space-y-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/[0.08] bg-white dark:bg-[#1e2025] p-5 sm:p-6 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-wider font-mono">
          4. Security & Compliance Contact
        </h2>
        <p>
          For questions regarding local-first execution compliance or audit inquiries: visit our <a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline font-semibold">Contact Desk</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
